    "details": "https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/23159 reports:\n\n> An out-of-bounds write vulnerability in FFmpeg\\'s libavcodec library,\n> specifically in the MagicYUV decoder, allows denial-of-service and, in\n> some cases, can be exploited for remote code execution. This\n> vulnerability is associated with the file libavcodec/magicyuv.C. This\n> issue affects FFmpeg before version 8.1.2.\n",
